msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:57
#: 1c0266536aaf4c7eaeed8b41a8d1ac4a 67f8392ee3064986ab894adf1db6e22f
#: 89b0ea27c25f43dca7a826929d50017f e1901687b4ac442c875ecb932d8ff4f7
#: f9f980e12ac24d59907fc1bb98314aad fe3d98186cac4f558d49061b4cfc7906
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:59
#: 004c9199ce6340e0b1d6afeb68b88a8d 51d16cf7bbab466eba3e0f0222747fe6
#: 66d8ced67931433eb0c6871e8ff4e705 b79f45e813be4af2a4d71fb02f76dbcc
#: cd418db788f1494fa07fb53c639c8077 d5854a1d669349bba4b68fcf31d0bb2b
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART4) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"要使用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需要使用完整的 UART，例如 "
"SERIAL6（UART4）用于接收机连接。以下是使用 Serial6 的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:61
#: 0250c16ad0b24d4e929f1c6120cd042d 0be7b6853467451dbdf72664c0aa7c3e
#: 2346a01b218f4f1d835f392da8fe3942 28791b62fd2d4fd086de884eab3adff7
#: 29de3bc403154357910c53fd3b4a85bc fc9bea36778f414387600a4b47ad48e2
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:63
#: 0152cb5ec3d342398d23bb8d08d41ff4 261c1af604e74f21b9f69c948a9e09a5
